# lancer - Area 1 mid-boss gunship. 56x48, 1 frame, straight top-down, faces DOWN.
# light: top-left. K exterior outline; seams only where planes meet (pods/struts/body, spine facets).
# Masses: broad olive body (bevelled plate, dark underside lip visible along the lower edges),
# raised two-facet dorsal spine, two side gun pods (cylinders) on short struts with open gaps,
# twin rear nozzles (top). Red: pod muzzle bands + prow sensor slit. Generated by s_lancer.py + touch-ups.
palette
. transparent
K #0b0d1a  outline
2 #2f3a5a  steel-1
3 #4a5a82  steel-2
a #1b2622  olive-0
b #31443a  olive-1
